    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'Connor & O'Connor are delighted to present No. 6 Irish Street, a bright and well-proportioned three-bedroom mid-terrace residence situated in the heart of Bunclody town.\n\nThe property offers flexible accommodation arranged over two floors, including a spacious living room, a bright kitchen with direct access to the rear garden, three bedrooms and two modern shower rooms. The downstairs bedroom could also be used as a guest room, children's bedroom or home office.\n\nIts central location places shops, cafés, schools and a wide range of everyday amenities within easy walking distance. With generous living accommodation, a private rear garden and an asking price of 185,000, this property will appeal to first-time buyers, investors and those wishing to live close to the town centre.\nThe property benefits from an attractive rear garden, accessed directly from the kitchen and offering a pleasant outdoor space. \nNo. 6 enjoys a highly convenient location on Irish Street in the centre of Bunclody. The property is within walking distance of local shops, cafés, schools and the town's many services and amenities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 11.12m x 3.23m\nA spacious living room with the front entrance opening directly into the room, wood-effect laminate flooring and a fireplace providing a lovely focal point.\n\nShower Room - 1.67m x1.49m\nA stylish and modern shower room featuring attractive half-wall tiling, a corner shower enclosure, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.54m x 2.17m\nA bright and versatile room with a window overlooking the rear garden. Carpeted flooring, ideal for use as a child's bedroom, guest room or home office.\n\nKitchen - 4.69m x 2.00m\nKitchen: A bright and welcoming kitchen filled with natural light, offering ample fitted storage and generous worktop space. Patio doors open directly onto the beautifully maintained rear garden.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.52m x 1.16m\nA beautiful, bright and generously sized double bedroom with carpeted flooring.\n\nShower Room - 2.59m x 1.12m\nA modern shower room featuring half-tiled walls, a shower enclosure, WC and wash-hand basin.\n\nLanding - 2.47m x 2.35m\nA generously sized landing providing access to the upstairs accommodation, with ample space and a bright, open feel.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.63m x 3.23m\nA bright and well-proportioned bedroom with carpeted flooring and a window overlooking the front of the property.\n\n"
      },
